      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feelings of being invisible and trapped are valid responses to a system that often ignores the human spirit behind the labor. Many others feel this profound disconnect, and breakthroughs often begin by seeking communities that validate your struggle or finding small moments of connection outside that cycle. Remember that the current routine is just one chapter, not the entire book of your life, and rewriting the plot always starts with believing the story can change.",
      "source": "target",
